From: Odilitime <janesmith@airmail.cc>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 10:07:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-metal: add Q2_0 backend support (upstream #25419)

Wire Q2_0 dequant/mul_mv/mul_mm/cpy/get_rows kernels so GGML_TYPE_Q2_0
weights stay on Metal instead of falling back to CPU.
